{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","hash":"c180f06bb0a113331c9eaf3ea4a577f330bd4d5958fef93b1d94e3b7d4d39460","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Bonne demande, je l'applique dès maintenant. Je prépare un plan de la carte, orienté comme elle est montée chez toi, avec J107, F104 et F105 repérés."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MYovx39eupMmeF3eH9dxRW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"s=\"/c/Users/vladi/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f/scratchpad\"; python -E -P -c \"\nimport sys\nfrom PIL import Image\nim = Image.open(sys.argv[1]); print(im.size, im.mode)\nr = im.rotate(-90, expand=True); print('rot', r.size); r.save(sys.argv[2])\nr.crop((380, 150, 900, 560)).resize((1040, 820)).save(sys.argv[3])\n\" \"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation.jpg\" \"$s/img/pd_layout_rot.png\" \"$s/img/pd_layout_rot_fuses.png\"","description":"Rotate the board layout drawing to the mounted orientation and crop the fuse area"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
