{"parentUuid":"4f79860f-23c5-44f1-a620-90734d6e8cf6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPEHU7HnXTZtyqAJfT21","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MKcgDwrNvcuJiRvtAuVZ9P","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -E -P -c \"\nimport sys\nfrom PIL import Image\nim = Image.open(sys.argv[1]).convert('RGB').rotate(-90, expand=True)\nim = im.resize((im.size[0]*2, im.size[1]*2), Image.LANCZOS)\nim.save(sys.argv[2]); print(im.size)\n\" \"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation.jpg\" \"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png\"; f=\"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/journal-diagnostic-the-shadow.md\"; python -E -P - \"$f\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\npath = sys.argv[1]\nwith open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\") as fh:\n    text = fh.read()\nold = \"- Ne rien inventer : demander une photo, une mesure ou un document si nécessaire.\"\nnew = (old + \"\\n- **Toute mention d'un composant, connecteur, fusible ou point de test de la carte s'accompagne d'une image annotée** (demande de l'utilisateur, 25/10/2026) : \"\n       \"photo de l'utilisateur annotée, ou plan d'implantation p. 2-9 **tourné de 90° dans le sens horaire** pour correspondre à la carte montée dans le fronton (J130 en bas, J101 à droite, fusibles F101–F105 verticaux, F101 à gauche et F105 à droite) : \"\n       \"`docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png`. Images annotées rangées dans `photos/`.\")\nassert text.count(old) == 1\ntext = text.replace(old, new)\nwith open(path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\") as fh:\n    fh.write(text)\nprint(\"ok\")\nEOF","description":"Save the rotated layout into docs and add the annotated-image rule to the journal"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_read_input_tokens":614991,"output_tokens":2741,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1096},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2741,"cache_read_input_tokens":614991,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01MKcgDwrNvcuJiRvtAuVZ9P":{"command":"python -E -P -c \"\nimport sys\nfrom PIL import Image\nim = Image.open(sys.argv[1]).convert('RGB').rotate(-90, expand=True)\nim = im.resize((im.size[0]*2, im.size[1]*2), Image.LANCZOS)\nim.save(sys.argv[2]); print(im.size)\n\" \"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation.jpg\" \"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png\"; f=\"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot/journal-diagnostic-the-shadow.md\"; python -E -P - \"$f\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\npath = sys.argv[1]\nwith open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\") as fh:\n    text = fh.read()\nold = \"- Ne rien inventer : demander une photo, une mesure ou un document si nécessaire.\"\nnew = (old + \"\\n- **Toute mention d'un composant, connecteur, fusible ou point de test de la carte s'accompagne d'une image annotée** (demande de l'utilisateur, 25/10/2026) : \"\n       \"photo de l'utilisateur annotée, ou plan d'implantation p. 2-9 **tourné de 90° dans le sens horaire** pour correspondre à la carte montée dans le fronton (J130 en bas, J101 à droite, fusibles F101–F105 verticaux, F101 à gauche et F105 à droite) : \"\n       \"`docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png`. Images annotées rangées dans `photos/`.\")\nassert text.count(old) == 1\ntext = text.replace(old, new)\nwith open(path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\") as fh:\n    fh.write(text)\nprint(\"ok\")\nEOF","description":"Save the rotated layout into docs and add the annotated-image rule to the journal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"36dd0e68-9eda-4ada-bd60-1d541c503d09","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPEHTb3QMD14nUEdjKR1","requestRef":"5880286f-4acf-48b8-a4e1-6aa408ca010b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"06a12179-c5d9-4f66-8e94-61af6f0ae9a8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:57:26.503Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
{"parentUuid":"06a12179-c5d9-4f66-8e94-61af6f0ae9a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPEHU7HnXTZtyqAJfT21","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TJta4L8XnTQUTqvTes9imy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-diagnostic-method.md","content":"---\nname: shadow-diagnostic-method\ndescription: \"How the user wants the Bally The Shadow pinball repair diagnosis run (one measurement at a time, journal file, challenge hypotheses, annotated images of board parts)\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\n  modified: 2026-10-25T16:58:00.000Z\n---\n\nFor the Bally The Shadow (1994, WPC-S) Power Driver diagnosis, guide exactly one manipulation or measurement per message (where, how, how to interpret), then wait for the result. Off-power checks first, account for charged capacitors, and never suggest powering on before the pre-reconnection checklist is done. Treat the user's recollections as uncertain, never as confirmed diagnoses, and contradict them when evidence requires. Answer in French.\n\nWhenever a message mentions a board component, connector, fuse or test point, also send an annotated image showing where it is (user asked on 2026-10-25). Use the user's own photo when it covers the spot; otherwise annotate the manual's layout (page 2-9) rotated 90° clockwise, which matches how the board is mounted in the backbox (J130 at the bottom, J101 on the right, fuses F101–F105 vertical with F101 left and F105 right). A pre-rotated copy is in `docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png`. Draw with PIL, save in `photos/`, send with SendUserFile.\n\n**Why:** the user asked for this explicitly; earlier unstructured measurements did not validate anything, and the Power Driver was already damaged several times. Finding parts from designators alone was hard for them.\n\n**How to apply:** start each session by reading `journal-diagnostic-the-shadow.md` (project root) and the `docs/` and `photos/` folders next to it (manual pages, A-12697 schematic, user photos); update the journal after each significant step (measurement table, hypothesis status, next step). The manual's solenoid/fuse table is wrong for this machine (Sol 01 and Sol 07 are on F104), so map coil supplies by measurement.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_read_input_tokens":614991,"output_tokens":2741,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1096},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2741,"cache_read_input_tokens":614991,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01TJta4L8XnTQUTqvTes9imy":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-diagnostic-method.md","content":"---\nname: shadow-diagnostic-method\ndescription: \"How the user wants the Bally The Shadow pinball repair diagnosis run (one measurement at a time, journal file, challenge hypotheses, annotated images of board parts)\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\n  modified: 2026-10-25T16:58:00.000Z\n---\n\nFor the Bally The Shadow (1994, WPC-S) Power Driver diagnosis, guide exactly one manipulation or measurement per message (where, how, how to interpret), then wait for the result. Off-power checks first, account for charged capacitors, and never suggest powering on before the pre-reconnection checklist is done. Treat the user's recollections as uncertain, never as confirmed diagnoses, and contradict them when evidence requires. Answer in French.\n\nWhenever a message mentions a board component, connector, fuse or test point, also send an annotated image showing where it is (user asked on 2026-10-25). Use the user's own photo when it covers the spot; otherwise annotate the manual's layout (page 2-9) rotated 90° clockwise, which matches how the board is mounted in the backbox (J130 at the bottom, J101 on the right, fuses F101–F105 vertical with F101 left and F105 right). A pre-rotated copy is in `docs/manuel-the-shadow/2-9_PD_implantation_orientee-comme-montee.png`. Draw with PIL, save in `photos/`, send with SendUserFile.\n\n**Why:** the user asked for this explicitly; earlier unstructured measurements did not validate anything, and the Power Driver was already damaged several times. Finding parts from designators alone was hard for them.\n\n**How to apply:** start each session by reading `journal-diagnostic-the-shadow.md` (project root) and the `docs/` and `photos/` folders next to it (manual pages, A-12697 schematic, user photos); update the journal after each significant step (measurement table, hypothesis status, next step). The manual's solenoid/fuse table is wrong for this machine (Sol 01 and Sol 07 are on F104), so map coil supplies by measurement.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"36dd0e68-9eda-4ada-bd60-1d541c503d09","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgPEHTb3QMD14nUEdjKR1","requestRef":"5880286f-4acf-48b8-a4e1-6aa408ca010b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d42f9b69-949f-4448-940c-146905621e7b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:57:33.687Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"extern