{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","hash":"ebb17fb4fe376ff81364bbcd4d92d50d05eefdaf3d03e92f527e8009724038f2","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: C:\\Users\\vladi\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\\scratchpad\\scripts\\annotate_j122_j126.py changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n19\tdef mark(x, y, text, color, lx, ly):\n20\t    d.ellipse([x - 12, y - 12, x + 12, y + 12], outline=color, width=4)\n21\t    d.line([x, y + 12, lx + 20, ly - 6], fill=color, width=3)\n22\t    label(lx, ly, text, color, small)\n23\t\n24\t\n25\t# J122 (outer row, 9 positions: 9 at left, 1 at right, key at 7)\n26\td.rectangle([818, 1790, 1020, 1862], outline=BLUE, width=5)\n27\tlabel(940, 1866, \"J122\", BLUE)\n28\tmark(918, 1825, \"5 = tieback\", RED, 700, 1920)\n29\tmark(998, 1825, \"1 = Sol 25 (Bleu-Marron)\", RED, 930, 1965)\n30\t# J126 (outer row, 13 positions: 13 at left, 1 at right, key at 9)\n31\td.rectangle([1104, 1790, 1388, 1862], outline=BLUE, width=5)\n32\tlabel(1300, 1866, \"J126\", BLUE)\n33\tmark(1162, 1825, \"11 = tieback\", RED, 1140, 1920)\n34\tmark(1222, 1825, \"8 = Sol 24 (Bleu-Gris)\", RED, 1290, 1965)\n35\t# F104 bottom clip\n36\td.rectangle([1264, 820, 1336, 870], outline=GREEN, width=5)\n37\tlabel(1360, 860, \"pointe noire : clip du BAS de F104 (50 V, comme TP6)\", GREEN, small)\n38\tlabel(300, 270, \"Power Driver vue comme dans le fronton (J130 en bas)\", (0, 0, 0))\n39\t\n40\tim.save(out_full)\n\nThe user hasn't heard from you in a while — say in a few words what you're doing, then continue.\n\n<total_tokens>14986234 tokens left</total_tokens>"}]}}
