{"parentUuid":"93a352a8-4096-4be9-92a1-d1846cb9165c","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"On s'assure que le flipper ne redétruira pas la Power Driver réparée ; il reste à tester les Sol 24, 25 et le tieback. Prochaine action : débrancher J126 et J122, puis mesurer depuis le clip du bas de F104.","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:52:56.473Z","uuid":"7290b29e-1739-4c88-9988-fd05ddf986b0","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
