{"parentUuid":"62213f8d-d66a-4a4b-949f-314096a52450","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"243ad601-4ae9-415b-90ee-842dbfdc398e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PV1QiUohTpSE2X7Zi82nU9","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-blog-work-log.md"}]},"uuid":"116a8c5b-365d-4e1c-9835-8ac8f2fdb149","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:58:06.018Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-blog-work-log.md","content":"---\nname: shadow-blog-work-log\ndescription: The user wants the Bally The Shadow repair turned into a blog-style work log at the end; keep carnet-de-bord.md updated each session\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\n  modified: 2026-10-25T18:57:24.198Z\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-25 the user asked to keep a trace of every step of the The Shadow repair so that, once it is finished, it can become a short work log in the form of a blog post. No need to write the article now.\n\n**Why:** the user wants to tell the story of the repair later, with the steps, surprises and lessons.\n\n**How to apply:** at the end of each session (or after a significant step), update `carnet-de-bord.md` in the project root: chronological narrative per session (date, times), what was done and why, results, turning points, corrections and mistakes made along the way, lessons learned, references to photos in `photos/`. Keep it separate from the technical `journal-diagnostic-the-shadow.md`. See [[shadow-diagnostic-method]].\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c8d05f60-13ff-4191-acbe-9aa2c33e0a4f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","root":null,"branch":null,"default_