{"parentUuid":"6d23cf65-b469-4d7b-bf49-652c99c6356e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2a61ef19-972b-4ec3-a9eb-b33ff6d0ee3c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HnkgkovVBb6MUPHb2R2pqz","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-github-backup.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"67e519f6-6e51-4a33-9452-64e8b6454af8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T06:09:44.988Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\vladi\\.claude\\projects\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\memory\\shadow-github-backup.md","oldString":"- It holds the project files: journal, carnet, `docs/`, `photos/`, `.remember/`.","newString":"- It holds the project files: journal, carnet, `docs/`, `photos/`.\n- It holds the `.remember/*.md` notes. The script force-adds them, because the Remember plugin's own `.gitignore` (`*`) excludes its folder. The plugin's `tmp/` and `logs/` are left out.","originalFile":"---\nname: shadow-github-backup\ndescription: The The Shadow project is backed up to the private GitHub repo salfab/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot; run sauvegarde.ps1 at the end of each session\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\n  modified: 2026-10-26T06:05:48.797Z\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-26 the user asked to back up the whole project to a private GitHub repo, so nothing is lost if their disk crashes. They allowed binaries (photos, PDFs) in the repo.\n\n- Repo: https://github.com/salfab/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot (private, branch `main`).\n- It holds the project files: journal, carnet, `docs/`, `photos/`, `.remember/`.\n- It also holds `.sauvegarde-claude/`:\n  - `memoire/`: a mirror of this memory folder;\n  - `sessions/`: the session transcripts, split into 40 MB `.partNNN` files above that size;\n  - `temp/`: the session scratchpads.\n- A `.ignore` file keeps ripgrep out of `.sauvegarde-claude/`.\n\n**Why:** the user fears losing the diagnostic work, the project memory and the session history. Claude Code also deletes local transcripts after 30 days by default.\n\n**How to apply:**\n- At the end of each session, first update the journal, `carnet-de-bord.md` and memory. Then run `pwsh -File sauvegarde.ps1` from the project root; it copies, commits and pushes.\n- Commit messages must not carry a `Co-Authored-By` trailer (the user's global rule).\n- Restore steps are in the repo's `README.md`.\n\nSee [[shadow-blog-work-log]].\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":13,"newStart":5,"newLines":14,"lines":["   node_type: memory","   type: project","   originSessionId: 67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","-  modified: 2026-10-26T06:05:48.797Z","+  modified: 2026-10-26T06:09:44.816Z"," ---"," "," On 2026-10-26 the user asked to back up the whole project to a private GitHub repo, so nothing is lost if their disk crashes. They allowed binaries (photos, PDFs) in the repo."," "," - Repo: https://github.com/salfab/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot (private, branch `main`).","-- It holds the project files: journal, carnet, `docs/`, `photos/`, `.remember/`.","+- It holds the project files: journal, carnet, `docs/`, `photos/`.","+- It holds the `.remember/*.md` notes. The script force-adds them, because the Remember plugin's own `.gitignore` (`*`) excludes its folder. The plugin's `tmp/` and `logs/` are left out."," - It also holds `.sauvegarde-claude/`:","   - `memoire/`: a mirror of this memory folder;","   - `sessions/`: the session transcripts, split into 40 MB `.partNNN` files above that size;"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e333608b-e8f8-442a-87cd-8ff373bb6933","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","root":"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified