{"parentUuid":"60f33e2c-2a0c-425a-9b44-5bd5968f81d4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14996512 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"789a5443-1d59-4d3a-98e0-f82832a20362","timestamp":"2026-11-01T09:03:36.450Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14996512 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
{"parentUuid":"789a5443-1d59-4d3a-98e0-f82832a20362","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01RUUjZ7D5kjDtL29wua49n7","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6abe4143-ae90-478c-81d9-748a4b600104","timestamp":"2026-11-01T09:03:40.144Z","session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
{"parentUuid":"6abe4143-ae90-478c-81d9-748a4b600104","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgbwQqL1PLQM4o5vBnkGw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Aucune rangée ne touche la masse : c'est bon, je l'ai noté dans le journal. Je suppose que tu as mesuré avec la pointe noire sur TP5 ; corrige-moi si ce n'est pas le cas.\n\nÇa renforce mon hypothèse. Si un fil du faisceau menait à un condensateur, on retrouverait aussi la valeur qui monte sur les rangées. Elle venait donc très probablement de la carte : soit tu as touché l'embase J138, soit la fiche était encore enfichée.\n\nIl reste la mesure la plus importante, **L1 sur les colonnes**. Une colonne qui touche la masse grillerait son transistor.\n- La fiche J138 doit être **débranchée** de la carte.\n- Multimètre en mode diode, pointe noire sur TP5.\n- Pointe rouge sur chaque contact de la **fiche** J138 : la lame métallique au-dessus de chaque fil, positions 1 à 7 puis 9.\n\nOn attend **OL partout**."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3477,"cache_read_input_tokens":341572,"output_tokens":351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3477,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":351,"cache_read_input_tokens":341572,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3477,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3477},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ebe3e5f0-c2de-406d-ae04-e44c1db46df3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgbwQpwx2xAtqLkRuxy93","requestRef":"40ddffea-6f2b-42a0-82c7-6b8a64233fa8","requeste