{"parentUuid":"f0431fbf-dd52-480f-a9c9-93c5bfb4285f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\vladi\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\\scratchpad\\scripts\\annotate_0r22.py","snippet":"7\td = ImageDraw.Draw(im)\n8\tfont = ImageFont.truetype(\"C:/Windows/Fonts/arialbd.ttf\", 50)\n9\tORANGE = (255, 120, 0)\n10\t\n11\tpairs = [(2340, 1585, 2505, 1810), (2340, 1900, 2505, 2180), (3085, 1605, 3260, 1830), (3075, 1995, 3250, 2220)]\n12\tfor box in pairs:\n13\t    d.rectangle(box, outline=ORANGE, width=9)\n14\ttext = \"Résistances 0,22 Ω des rangées (R150–R153, R172–R175)\"\n15\tx, y = 2290, 1345\n16\tl, t, r, b = d.textbbox((x, y), text, font=font)\n17\td.rectangle([l - 10, t - 8, r + 10, b + 8], fill=(255, 255, 255), outline=ORANGE, width=6)\n18\td.text((x, y), text, font=font, fill=ORANGE)\n19\tfor x0, y0, x1, _ in []:\n20\t    d.line([(x0 + x1) // 2, b + 8, (x0 + x1) // 2, y0], fill=ORANGE, width=5)\n21\t\n22\tim.crop((2200, 1300, 4000, 2330)).save(out, quality=90)\n23\tprint(\"ok\")"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"27ab4f6e-5b2d-443d-b516-93101586c3c3","timestamp":"2026-11-01T09:33:41.063Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: C:\\Users\\vladi\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--sources-the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot\\67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f\\scratchpad\\scripts\\annotate_0r22.py changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n7\td = ImageDraw.Draw(im)\n8\tfont = ImageFont.truetype(\"C:/Windows/Fonts/arialbd.ttf\", 50)\n9\tORANGE = (255, 120, 0)\n10\t\n11\tpairs = [(2340, 1585, 2505, 1810), (2340, 1900, 2505, 2180), (3085, 1605, 3260, 1830), (3075, 1995, 3250, 2220)]\n12\tfor box in pairs:\n13\t  